{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bde0cdbf-d764-86f8-97e3-3b30c1dc94dc",
  "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:27:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gino Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello. Um, my trash bin, the big one, it's gone. They came this morning for the pickup and now I can't find it anywhere. [pause] Hold on, I got a bag in my hand here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:25:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. So the bin went missing after the pickup this morning. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:25:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. It was at the curb last night, and then, uh, the truck came, and now there's nothing. Not at the curb, not down the street. I looked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:25:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I get the address where it should be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "154 Kingston Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "154 Kingston Avenue. Got it. And is it the trash bin or the recycling one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash. The green, no, the, uh, [inaudible] the dark one with the lid. I need it back, my nephew is staying with me for the week and he eats constantly. There's garbage every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so you'll want it sooner than later. I'll put in a request for a replacement bin to 154 Kingston Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a fee for that? [rustling] Sorry, I'm putting groceries away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. For a bin that's missing, I'd have the crew look into it when they follow up, and if there's any charge they'll tell you then. I don't have a figure in front of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So somebody calls me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can have them call. What number is best?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0170. That's the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read it back. 401-555-0170. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So that's a missing trash bin at 154 Kingston Avenue after this morning's pickup, and they'll call you at that number. In the meantime, if you have to, bag it up and keep it inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll do that. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Lombardozzi. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-04T14:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
